#: plugins/ocr/gocr/kookaocr-gocr.json
msgctxt "Description"
msgid ""
"<emphasis>GOCR</emphasis> (sometimes known as <emphasis>JOCR</emphasis>) is "
"an open source OCR engine, originally started by Joerg&nbsp;Schulenburg and "
"now with a team of active developers.<nl/><nl/>See <link url=\"http://jocr."
"sourceforge.net\">jocr.sourceforge.net</link> for more information on GOCR."
msgstr ""
"<emphasis>GOCR</emphasis> (ponekad poznat i kao <emphasis>JOCR</emphasis>) "
"je OCR program otvorenog koda čiji je razvoj započeo Joerg&nbsp;Schulenburg, "
"a danas na njemu radi aktivni tim programera.<nl/><nl/>Više informacija o "
"GOCR-u potražite na stranici <link url=\"http://jocr.sourceforge.net\">"
"jocr.sourceforge.net</link>."

#: plugins/ocr/ocrad/kookaocr-ocrad.json
msgctxt "Description"
msgid ""
"<emphasis>OCRAD</emphasis> is a free software OCR engine by Antonio&nbsp;"
"Diaz, part of the GNU&nbsp;Project.<nl/><nl/>Images for OCR should be "
"scanned in black/white (lineart) mode. Best results are achieved if the "
"characters are at least 20&nbsp;pixels high. Problems may arise, as usual, "
"with very bold or very light or broken characters, or with merged character "
"groups.<nl/><nl/>See <link url=\"http://www.gnu.org/software/ocrad/ocrad.html"
"\">www.gnu.org/software/ocrad/ocrad.html</link> for more information on "
"OCRAD."
msgstr ""
"<emphasis>OCRAD</emphasis> je besplatan OCR program Antonija&nbsp;Diaza, "
"dio projekta GNU.<nl/><nl/>Slike za OCR treba skenirati u crno-bijelom "
"načinu rada (linijska grafika). Najbolji se rezultati postižu kada su "
"znakovi visoki barem 20&nbsp;piksela. Uobičajeni problemi mogu se pojaviti "
"kod vrlo debelih, vrlo tankih ili oštećenih znakova te spojenih skupina "
"znakova.<nl/><nl/>Više informacija o OCRAD-u potražite na stranici <link "
"url=\"http://www.gnu.org/software/ocrad/ocrad.html\">"
"www.gnu.org/software/ocrad/ocrad.html</link>."

#: plugins/ocr/tesseract/kookaocr-tesseract.json
msgctxt "Description"
msgid ""
"<emphasis>Tesseract</emphasis> is a free software OCR engine, originally "
"developed at HP&nbsp;Labs and now sponsored by Google. It supports multiple "
"languages and scripts (including right-to-left text) and page layout "
"analysis.<nl/><nl/>The best results are achieved if scanned characters are "
"at least 20&nbsp;pixels high. Problems may arise with excessively skewed or "
"rotated images, or if dark borders are present.<nl/><nl/>See <link url="
"\"https://github.com/tesseract-ocr/tesseract\">github.com/tesseract-ocr/"
"tesseract</link> for more information on Tesseract."
msgstr ""
"<emphasis>Tesseract</emphasis> je besplatan OCR program koji je izvorno "
"razvijen u laboratorijima HP&nbsp;Labs, a sada ga podupire Google. Podržava "
"više jezika i pisama (uključujući tekst zdesna nalijevo) te analizu "
"rasporeda stranice.<nl/><nl/>Najbolji se rezultati postižu ako su skenirani "
"znakovi visoki barem 20&nbsp;piksela. Problemi se mogu pojaviti kod "
"pretjerano ukošenih ili zakrenutih slika ili ako su prisutni tamni "
"rubovi.<nl/><nl/>Više informacija o Tesseractu potražite na stranici "
"<link url=\"https://github.com/tesseract-ocr/tesseract\">"
"github.com/tesseract-ocr/tesseract</link>."
